Subject: [PATCH] onprem: Mapping page (jobs, image selection, result layers on
 the map)

New page 'Mapping' for the AeroNexus mapping service (mapping-tool/service,
VITE_MAPPING_URL): job list with status/progress, new-job dialog with image
selection from the media uploaded by Pilot 2 and processing profile, result
layers as Leaflet tile layers with visibility, opacity and zoom-to.
